cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite Geogram.
title: Geogram subset for curvenet.elf (vendored)
abstract: >-
  Geogram 1.9.9 (upstream BrunoLevy/geogram c40b4653) as the org's Godot fork
  carries it under thirdparty/geogram, with that fork's -fno-exceptions
  patches. Subset: the 61 sources modules/cassie/SCsub compiles
  (basic minus geofile/android_utils/boolean_expression, numerics,
  mesh/mesh and mesh_reorder, delaunay minus tetgen/triangle/
  parallel_delaunay_3d, points minus co3ne, bibliography, OpenNL .c),
  plus delaunay/delaunay_2d.cpp, which SCsub left out; the 122 headers
  those sources and mwt's DelaunayFaces.cpp include, transitively; and
  zlib.h/zconf.h from thirdparty/zlib (headers only, geofile.h wants them,
  nothing links zlib). 185 files, 3,614,343 bytes before this file.
  tools/vendor/thirdparty_subset.sh reproduces the tree from the pinned
  commit. Local adaptation (tools/vendor/patches/geogram.patch):
  delaunay/delaunay.cpp registers the "BDEL2d" and "BPOW2d" creators again
  (the fork dropped them with delaunay_2d.cpp), so Cassie's
  delaunay_triangulate_2d_raw can create a Delaunay2d.
type: software
authors:
